ates", "3D Printers (Rapid Prototyping)"], "volume": "Low to mid volume, rapid prototyping", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["36,000 sq ft facility integrating engineering, machining, and electronics assembly", "On-time and on-budget performance commended by customers", "Wire EDM capability down to 0.001 inch wire size", "Dual automated pick-and-place lines handling 0201 and BGA components", "2D high-resolution X-ray and AOI inspection in-house"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Albuquerque, New Mexico -> db", "Facility size: 36,000 sq ft -> /", "Services: design, engineering, manufacturing -> /", "Machine shop capabilities: CNC milling, lathe, wire/sinker EDM, grinding, welding -> /", "Electronics capabilities: PCB assembly, SMT, PTH, pick & place, X-ray, AOI, ICT -> /", "Metrology: DCC CMMs, optical video gauge, surface plates -> /", "Industries: government, commercial, aerospace, biomedical, RF/video/data, energetic materials -> /", "Volume: High Mix/Low to Mid Volume to Rapid Prototyping -> /", "Differentiators: on-time/on-budget, integrated facility, wire EDM 0.001\", pick & place 0201/BGA, X-ray/AOI -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "From new product design, development and supplemental engineering services to manufacturing services, TEAM supports government and commercial clients with innovative solutions.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='team-technologies' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Tech Partners Hawaii has provided IT support from its Wailuku, Maui base for over two decades.

The firm delivers a full stack of managed technology services: managed IT, IT consulting, VoIP, Microsoft 365 administration, cloud solutions, cybersecurity, backup and disaster recovery, and network management. Its team holds multiple certifications and operates a 24/7 help desk to keep client systems running continuously.

Customers span Hawaii''s key sectors, including hospitality and tourism, non-profits, development and construction, manufacturing, medical practices, and agriculture. The company tailors its support to the operational rhythms of each industry, from resort networks to clinic compliance requirements.

