UPDATE companies SET description='Teknic, Inc. is based in Victor, New York, where it designs and manufactures brushless DC and AC servo motors and motion-control drives. The company’s product portfolio centers on integrated servo systems that combine motor, encoder, drive, and controller in a single package.

Teknic’s flagship ClearPath line comprises all-in-one servo motors available in over 1,000 part numbers, each integrating a brushless permanent-magnet motor, high-resolution encoder, digital servo drive, and motion controller. The company also produces the Hudson series of BLDC servo motors, Meridian integrated motion controllers and digital servo drives, Eclipse digital servo drives, ClearCore and ClearLink I/O and motion controllers, IPC intelligent DC power supplies, planetary gearboxes, motor brakes, and gearmotor solutions. Many products carry a three-year warranty, and the IPC power supplies are built in the United States.

The company serves original equipment manufacturers and industrial automation customers in applications such as conveyors, packaging systems, pumps, and indexing equipment. Its motion controllers support EtherNet/IP, EtherCAT, step-and-direction, and software API interfaces, targeting machine builders who need precise, ripple-free motion across a range of torque and speed requirements.

Teknic emphasizes proprietary algorithms such as g-Stop anti-resonance, RAS motion smoothing, and the Accelerated Prototyping System to reduce development time and improve machine performance. The company sells directly online with a 90-day satisfaction guarantee on select items and highlights U.S. manufacturing for its power supply line.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Brushless DC/AC servo motor manufacturing", "Motion control drive manufacturing", "Integrated servo motor assembly (motor, encoder, drive, controller)", "Digital servo drive design", "Motion controller development (EtherNet/IP, EtherCAT, Step & Direction, Software API)", "Power supply design for motion control (IPC)", "Planetary gearbox manufacturing", "Motor brake manufacturing (spring-applied power-off)", "Gearmotor solutions", "Online configuration and selection tools", "Rapid prototyping and diagnostic software (Accelerated Prototyping System)", "Anti-resonance algorithms (g-Stop)", "Motion smoothing algorithms (RAS)", "Quickset digital oscilloscope and move generator"], "industries": ["OEM machinery", "Conveying systems", "Packaging machinery", "Pump systems", "Indexing equipment", "Industrial automation"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Three-year warranty on most products", "IPC power supplies built in the USA", "Over 1,000 ClearPath part numbers available", "Proprietary g-Stop anti-resonance and RAS motion smoothing algorithms", "Direct online purchasing with 90-day satisfaction guarantee on select items"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Victor, New York -> db", "ROHS certification -> db", "Manufactures brushless DC/AC servo motors and motion-control drives -> db", "ClearPath all-in-one servo motors with 1000+ part numbers -> /", "IPC power supplies built in the USA -> /", "3-year warranty on many products -> /", "Proprietary g-Stop anti-resonance and RAS motion smoothing algorithms -> /", "Accele