UPDATE companies SET description='Tennessee Peanut Co. was founded in 2019 by Jay Cleveland and his family in Nashville, Tennessee. The company began at local farmers markets, selling traditionally roasted in-shell peanuts, and has since grown into a family-owned operation that emphasizes wholesome, USA-grown products.

The company specializes in artisan roasting of in-shell peanuts, offering three core varieties: Salty, Cajun, and Raw (suitable for boiling). Peanuts are sourced 100% from U.S. growers and roasted using the original recipes from the farmers market days. Products are packaged in 1-ounce single-serve packs, 2-pound bags, and 10-pack display boxes, and the line also includes gift boxes, candies, chocolates, and general mercantile items.

Tennessee Peanut Co. serves both retail and wholesale channels, with a store locator for direct consumer sales and a dedicated wholesale program for retailers and specialty food shops. Its products appear in gift and snack categories, targeting consumers seeking traditional Southern snacks and businesses looking for American-made peanut products.

The Cleveland family frames the business as a way to pass wholesome products from one family to another, highlighting intentional packaging designed to be kept rather than discarded. The brand also notes its peanuts were voted a top-five selection, though the specific contest is not detailed.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Peanut roasting", "In-shell peanut packaging", "Wholesale distribution", "Retail packaging (1oz, 2lb, display boxes)", "Gift box assembly"], "industries": ["Food and beverage", "Snack food", "Retail", "Wholesale", "Gift and specialty foods"], "materials": ["USA-grown peanuts"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Original farmers-market recipes retained", "100% USA-grown peanuts", "Family-owned and operated since 2019", "Intentional packaging designed for reuse"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2019 by Jay Cleveland and family in Nashville, TN -> /", "Produces artisan roasted in-shell peanuts (Salty, Cajun, Raw) -> /", "Peanuts are 100% USA-grown -> /", "Offers wholesale and retail packaging (1oz, 2lb, display boxes) -> /", "Family-owned business emphasizing wholesome products -> /", "Intentional packaging design noted -> /", "Voted top 5 (unspecified) -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "artisan roasted peanuts", "founded_year": "2019", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='tennessee-peanut-co' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Terahertz Device Corporation operates from Salt Lake City, Utah.

The firm develops and manufactures mid-infrared light-emitting diodes and detectors for gas sensing applications. Its proprietary QuiC SLED™ technology captures the mid-infrared fingerprints of gases such as methane, carbon dioxide, refrigerants, and volatile organic compounds. The product line includes mid-IR LEDs, gas sensing LEDs, sensor modules, semiconductor chips, custom assemblies, and licensing of its technology.

The company serves markets including health tracking capnography, personal air quality monitoring, automotive, oil and gas, and smart building HVAC systems. It has engaged with regulatory developments, such as EPA actions on hydrofluorocarbons, and its representatives have presented at EPA methane detection workshops. Custom solutions are offered for specific sensing needs.

