UPDATE companies SET description='TianBa Process Equipment USA, LLC is based in Sarasota, Florida. The company was founded in 1999 as a food process equipment specialist focused on thermal treatment processing solutions for global markets.

The company designs, develops, manufactures, and commercializes fully automated HTST pasteurization and UHT aseptic sterilization systems. It also provides upstream blending and processing systems, downstream aseptic tank systems, and turnkey blending, clean-in-place (CIP), and thermal processing solutions. TianBa has installed more than 250 dairy, beverage, and food process systems worldwide, and offers the ProcessEasy™ automation platform for centralized equipment control.

TianBa serves the dairy, beverage, and food processing industries, with systems operating across North and South America, North and South Asia, Central America, and Africa. Its equipment produces aseptic milk, juice, sauces, coffee, tea, fruit juices, and ready-to-drink products in both refrigerated and shelf-stable packages.

The company emphasizes innovation, quality, safety, and environmental responsibility. Its mission includes delivering customized solutions, implementing industry trends in equipment designs, manufacturing reliable components, providing outstanding customer service, and offering fair prices. A strong R&D team focuses on pasteurization, sterilization, and particulate processing, maintaining close customer collaboration throughout design and commissioning.', certifications=ARRAY['3A','CHEDG','FDA','USDA','PMO','ISO 9001','ASME','UL','CE']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["HTST pasteurization system design and manufacturing", "UHT aseptic sterilization system design and manufacturing", "Upstream blending and processing system design and installation", "Downstream aseptic tank system design and installation", "Turnkey blending, CIP, and thermal processing solutions", "ProcessEasy\u2122 automation system integration", "R&D for pasteurization, sterilization, and particulate processing", "Customer service and after-sales support", "Installation and start-up support services", "Replacement parts and consumables supply"], "industries": ["Dairy processing", "Beverage processing", "Food processing", "Fruit juice processing", "Sauce manufacturing", "Ready-to-drink beverage production"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["HTST pasteurization systems", "UHT aseptic sterilization systems", "ProcessEasy\u2122 automation system", "Blending systems", "CIP systems", "Aseptic tank systems", "UHT Sterilizer for Fruit Pulps and Particles"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Over 250 thermal processing systems installed globally", "Fully automated HTST pasteurization and UHT aseptic sterilization systems", "Turnkey blending, CIP, and thermal processing solutions", "ProcessEasy\u2122 automation system for centralized equipment control", "Compliance with 3A, FDA, USDA, PMO, ISO 9001, ASME, UL, CE standards"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1999 -> /about-us", "Headquarters in Sarasota, Florida -> db", "Installed over 250 dairy, beverage, and food process systems globally -> /", "Designs, develops, manufactures, and commercializes HTST pasteurization and UHT aseptic sterilization systems -> /about-us", "Provides upstream blending and processing systems, downstream aseptic tank systems, turnkey blending, CIP, and thermal processing solutions -> /about-us", "Offers ProcessEasy\u2122 automation system for centralized equipment control -> /", "Serves dairy, beverage, and food industries worldwide -> /about-us", "Systems produce aseptic milk, juice, sauces, coffee, tea, fruit juices, ready-to-drink products -> /", "Complies with 3A, CHEDG, FDA, USDA, PMO, ISO 9001, ASME, UL, CE standards -> /quality", "Strong R&D team with expertise in pasteurization, sterilization, and particulate processing -> /about-us", "Mission: deliver customized solutions, implement industry trends, manufacture reliable equipment, provide outstanding customer service, offer fair prices -> /", "Core values: Innovation, Quality, Safety, Environmental responsibility -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "TianBa Process Equipment designs, develops, manufactures, and commercializes fully automated thermal pasteurization HTST and aseptic sterilization UHT systems.", "founded_year": "1999", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='tianba-process-equipment-usa-llc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Tipton Mills Foods LLC operates from Columbus, Indiana, where it produces custom-blended food and beverage powders for brand owners. The company''s founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed, but it presents itself as a partner for formulation, supply chain management, manufacturing, packaging, and distribution of powdered products.

The facility runs 11 packaging lines capable of filling pouches, sticks, cans, and jars. Its proprietary Sure-Blend agglomeration process is designed to improve powder dispensability by up to 95 percent. The company handles nutritional, convenience, and indulgence product categories, offering turnkey services from recipe development through to finished goods, including private labeling and quality control.

Tipton Mills serves powdered-beverage brand owners, consumer beverage companies, and growing brands that need to scale quickly. Its Express Launch Process has helped more than a dozen clients increase production within 60 days, enabling placement in national retail chains. The company also works with brands facing out-of-stock issues and solubility challenges.

