UPDATE companies SET description='Tokyo Electron America operates from Manassas, Virginia, as the U.S. arm of Tokyo Electron Ltd., a Japanese public company that has cultivated semiconductor process technology for over six decades. The American subsidiary focuses on developing, manufacturing, and selling semiconductor production equipment while providing related technical support and parts services.

