UPDATE companies SET description='TouchPad Electronics LLC is based in Mukwonago, Wisconsin. The company was founded in 2000 as TouchPad Design Corporation, a privately owned electrical engineering and PCB layout design firm that offered ultra-fast turnaround for advanced technology PCB designs. This early focus forged a culture of urgency, quality, and responsiveness that continues today.

Today TouchPad provides end-to-end electronics manufacturing services, including PCB design and layout, quick-turn prototype and production assembly, microcontroller-based design, flexible circuit and membrane switch design, and RF, analog, and digital circuit engineering. The company also handles sub-assembly, touchscreen and digital display manufacturing, user interface design, cable and harness assembly, and test fixture fabrication. Operations are housed in a 22,500‑square‑foot facility equipped with six SMT and selective soldering lines, automated optical inspection, X‑ray inspection, and multiple flex placement machines. Staffing has grown significantly since 2010, with the engineering and technical team expanding through multiple hiring phases.

TouchPad serves customers in medical, industrial, consumer, and advanced research sectors, including organizations involved in industrial control and human‑machine interface (HMI) technology. The company describes its client base as the “who’s who” in those markets, emphasizing relationships where quality, delivery, and value are prime factors.

The company’s stated mission is to provide unmatched technical value by applying superior processes with a sense of urgency and innovation to deliver timely results and product excellence. TouchPad differentiates itself with a custom ERP system that enables live component sourcing—reportedly establishing 95 % of component availability and pricing within minutes—and a quoting turnaround of less than 24 hours. ISO 9001:2008 registration covers hardware, software, mechanical engineering, PCB layout, and manufacturing.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2008']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["PCB design and layout", "Quick-turn PCB prototype assembly", "PCB production assembly", "Microcontroller-based design", "Flexible printed circuit (FPC) design", "Flex and membrane switch design", "RF, analog, and digital circuit design", "Sub-assembly services", "Touchscreen and digital display manufacturing", "User interface (UI) design", "Cable and harness assembly", "Test fixture design and manufacturing", "Bare PCB procurement", "Selective soldering", "Automated optical inspection (AOI)", "X-ray inspection", "Component sourcing and procurement", "Project management and scheduling", "Custom ERP and real-time job tracking"], "industries": ["Medical", "Industrial", "Consumer", "Research", "Industrial control and HMI"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Flex placement machines", "Selective soldering machines", "Automated optical inspection (AOI) station", "X-ray inspection system", "SMT production lines (6)"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Quote in less than 24 hours", "Custom ERP with live component sourcing (95% availability within minutes)", "ISO 9001:2008 registered across engineering and manufacturing disciplines", "Quick-turn PCB prototype and production assembly", "End-to-end design, assembly, and manufacturing solutions"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2000 as TouchPad Design Corporation -> /about-us", "Privately owned -> /about-us", "Headquarters in Mukwonago, Wisconsin -> db", "Facility 22,500 sq ft in 2020 -> /about-us", "ISO 9001:2008 registered -> /about-us", "Quick-turn PCB assembly -> /", "Quote in less than 24 hours -> /", "Industries served: medical, industrial, consumer, research -> /", "Capabilities: PCB design, assembly, sub-assembly, etc. -> /services", "Equipment: flex placement machines, selective soldering, AOI, X-ray -> /about-us", "Custom ERP with live component sourcing -> /about-us", "Mission statement -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Sub-assembly services as well as design and manufacturing of touchscreen and digital displays, UI, cable and harnesses, and test fixtures.", "founded_year": "2000", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='touchpad-electronics-llc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Tower Manufacturing Corporation was founded in 1957 by Louis Shatkin in Providence, Rhode Island. The company remains under his active leadership and has grown from a regional operation into an international supplier with manufacturing sites in Providence and Shenzhen, China, plus sales offices in Hong Kong and Taiwan.

The company produces electrical safety devices — including ground-fault circuit interrupters (GFCI), leakage-current detection interrupters (LCDI), equipment leakage-current interrupters (ELCI), and appliance leakage-current interrupters (ALCI) — as well as electromechanical components such as printed circuit board assemblies, thermostats, switches, windings, solenoids, wire harnesses, and overload protection. Its Shenzhen facility spans roughly 250,000 square feet and employs about 3,000 production workers, while the Providence headquarters houses an engineering team with over 100 years of combined design experience and an on-site laboratory where qualification testing is witnessed by UL and cUL representatives.

Tower serves the construction, commercial/industrial, and residential markets, and provides OEM safety products to Fortune 500 companies. The firm participates in standards bodies including NEMA, NFPA, AHAM, and NEC, and sits on UL’s 1699 STP committee for LCDI/AFCI.

