UPDATE companies SET description='Transpacific Food Inc opened its doors in 2000 in Salem, Oregon, under the leadership of CEO Bob Underwood, a third-generation farmer whose family experience in agriculture shapes the company’s approach. The business began with a focus on delivering high-quality fruit products to buyers seeking reliable sourcing and consistent quality.

The company produces high-quality fruit purees and creates custom formulations tailored to client specifications for color, consistency, and flavor. Its laboratory serves as an R&D partner, developing pure fruit blends for both large manufacturers needing agility and smaller brands requiring cost-effective product development. Transpacific sources berries and fruit from domestic and international growers, managing a supply chain that includes rigorous quality assurance, food safety documentation, and hands-on inspections at grower and co-packer facilities. The operation handles orders ranging from unique small batches to million-pound volumes, and also assists with logistics, packaging, and labeling challenges.

Larger companies leverage the firm’s formulation expertise and flexible production, while smaller businesses use its R&D services to bring products to market. The company’s customer base spans any sector requiring consistent, high-quality fruit ingredients.

The company says its differentiation lies in a vast sourcing network that draws from the Pacific Northwest and global regions, combined with a stringent approval process that includes in-person inspections of every grower and co-packer. Its mission emphasizes innovation, creativity, integrity, and efficiency, aiming to be the first call for fruit buyers. The leadership’s generational farming background informs a commitment to delivering fruit at peak quality, backed by a quality assurance program that spans from field to delivery.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Fruit puree production", "Custom formulation development", "Research and development (R&D) for fruit blends", "Berry and fruit sourcing (domestic and international)", "Quality assurance and food safety program", "Hands-on grower and co-packer inspections", "Logistics, packaging, and labeling support", "Small batch and large volume production"], "industries": ["Food and beverage manufacturing", "Fruit processing", "Ingredient supply", "Product development / R&D"], "materials": ["Berries", "Fruit", "Fruit purees", "Fruit blends"], "equipment": [], "volume": "Small batches to million-pound orders", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Custom formulations matched to color, consistency, and flavor specifications", "Laboratory-based R&D for pure fruit blends", "Rigorous quality assurance and food safety program with hands-on grower/co-packer inspections", "Domestic and international sourcing network for berries and fruit", "Problem-solving support for logistics, packaging, and labeling"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2000 -> /about", "Headquarters in Salem, Oregon -> db", "CEO Bob Underwood, third-generation farmer -> /", "Produces high-quality purees -> /", "Creates custom formulations based on color, consistency, flavor specifications -> /", "Laboratory expertise for R&D partnerships -> /about", "Sources berries domestically and internationally -> /about, /quality", "Quali