UPDATE companies SET description='Tru Fru operates from Salt Lake City, Utah. Public sources do not disclose the company''s founding year, ownership structure, or the names of its founders.

The company manufactures two distinct product lines: Hyper-Chilled, featuring frozen fresh fruit enrobed in chocolate, and Hyper-Dried, featuring freeze-dried fruit enrobed in chocolate. The assortment spans strawberries, raspberries, bananas, blueberries, cherries, and pineapple, with coatings that include dark chocolate, milk chocolate, white chocolate, and combinations such as dark and white or milk and white. Several SKUs incorporate Greek yogurt, granola, peanut butter, coconut, or a crème layer. The company does not publish facility square footage, employee headcount, or annual production volumes.

Distribution reaches consumers through the company''s e-commerce site and through brick-and-mortar retail. Customer testimonials on the site reference purchases at Costco and at Walmart checkout displays, suggesting placement in warehouse clubs and mass-market grocery chains.

Marketing materials highlight simple ingredient lists and a positioning as a better-for-you sweet snack, with reviewers commenting on the nutritional facts relative to conventional chocolate-dipped fruit. A dedicated "How It''s Made" page exists on the site, though its content is not provided in the available data. No explicit founding story or stated differentiation beyond product formulation is documented.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Freeze-dried fruit production", "Frozen fruit processing", "Chocolate enrobing/coating", "Multi-ingredient inclusion blending (yogurt, granola, nut butters, coconut)"], "industries": ["Consumer packaged goods", "Food retail", "E-commerce food", "Club stores", "Mass-market grocery"], "materials": ["Strawberries", "Raspberries", "Bananas", "Blueberries", "Cherries", "Pineapple", "Dark chocolate", "Milk chocolate", "White chocolate", "Greek yogurt", "Granola", "Peanut butter", "Coconut", "Cr\u00e8me"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Two product formats: frozen fresh (Hyper-Chilled) and freeze-dried (Hyper-Dried)", "Six fruit varieties across chocolate coatings", "Direct-to-consumer e-commerce channel", "Retail distribution in warehouse clubs and mass-market grocery"], "facts_used": ["Company name: Tru Fru -> db", "Headquarters: Salt Lake City, Utah -> db", "Website: trufru.com -> db", "Product lines: Hyper-Chilled (frozen fresh) and Hyper-Dried (freeze-dried) -> /", "Fruit varieties: strawberries, raspberries, bananas, blueberries, cherries, pineapple -> /", "Chocolate coatings: dark, milk, white, combinations -> /", "Inclusions: Greek yogurt, granola, peanut butter, coconut, cr\u00e8me -> /", "Retail presence: Costco, Walmart mentioned in customer reviews -> /", "Direct-to-consumer sales via website -> /", "How It''s Made page referenced -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Frozen Fresh Nature''s Fruit in Choc