UPDATE companies SET description='Semiconductor Solutions was founded in 2006 and is based in Brooklyn Park, Minnesota. The company operates as a small business concern and non‑traditional defense contractor with DoD Category 1A Accreditation. No individual founders are named in the public materials.

The firm functions as a fabless semiconductor design and product development house, specializing in radiation‑hardened microelectronics. Its service portfolio covers analog/mixed‑signal and ASIC/SoC design, semiconductor IP development, chiplet and high‑density package design, wafer foundry coordination, package assembly, test and screening, printed circuit board design, and procurement services. The engineering staff includes IC design and verification engineers, analog/mixed‑signal/digital IP designers, package designers, board designers, and system engineers. Facility size, headcount, and production volumes are not disclosed.

Semiconductor Solutions serves aerospace, defense, industrial, medical, avionics, military, and space markets. Its microelectronics enable next‑generation systems as well as sustainment of mission‑critical platforms, including legacy part replacement for obsolete commercial‑off‑the‑shelf components.

The company differentiates itself through its fabless model, which provides access to state‑of‑the‑practice (45 nm and above) and state‑of‑the‑art (sub‑28 nm) foundry technologies such as CMOS, SOI, FinFET, SiGe, BiCMOS, bipolar, and gate‑all‑around processes. It positions itself as a single point of contact from design through delivery, offering program management, consulting, and customer service.', certifications=ARRAY['ITAR compliant','EAR compliant','DoD Category 1A Trusted Accreditation','AS9100D Quality System']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Analog/Mixed Signal Design", "ASIC/SoC Design", "IP Development", "Radiation Hardening", "Wafer Foundry Services", "Package Design & Assembly", "Testing and Screening", "Board Design", "Procurement Services", "Chiplet Products", "High-Density Package Solutions", "Printed Circuit Board Design", "Electronic Systems Design", "Failure Analysis Testing", "Device Qualification Testing", "Radiation Effects Testing", "TCAD Simulation Services", "Signal Integrity Analysis", "Thermal Analysis", "Power Analysis", "Custom Source Control Drawings", "Part Number Management", "COTS Procurement"], "industries": ["Aerospace", "Defense", "Industrial", "Medical", "Avionics", "Military", "Space"], "materials": ["Organic", "Glass", "Silicon", "Ceramic"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["DoD Category 1A Trusted Accreditation", "ITAR and EAR compliant", "Fabless model with foundry partnerships spanning 45\u202fnm to sub\u201128\u202fnm nodes", "Single point of contact for design\u2011through\u2011delivery with program management", "Radiation hardening expertise across total dose, single event effects, neutron, and proton testing"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2006 -> /about-us", "Headquartered in Minneapolis, MN with offices in West Lafayette, IN and Odon, IN -> /about-us", "Small Business Concern, Non-traditional Defense Contractor, Category 1A Trusted Accreditation -> /about-us", "ITAR and 